 111:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c **** 
 112:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c **** /** @defgroup RCC_Exported_Functions_Group1 Initialization and de-initialization functions
 113:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   *  @brief    Initialization and Configuration functions
 114:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   *
 115:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   @verbatim
 116:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   ===============================================================================
 117:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****            ##### Initialization and de-initialization functions #####
 118:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   ===============================================================================
 119:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****     [..]
 120:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****       This section provides functions allowing to configure the internal/external oscillators
 121:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****       (HSE, HSI, LSE, LSI, PLL, CSS and MCO) and the System buses clocks (SYSCLK, AHB, APB1
 122:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****       and APB2).
 123:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c **** 
 124:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****     [..] Internal/external clock and PLL configuration
 125:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****       (#) HSI (high-speed internal), 16 MHz factory-trimmed RC used directly or through
 126:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****           the PLL as System clock source.
 127:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****       (#) LSI (low-speed internal), ~40 KHz low consumption RC used as IWDG and/or RTC
 128:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****           clock source.
 129:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c **** 
 130:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****       (#) HSE (high-speed external), 4 to 32 MHz (PY32E407) crystal oscillator used directly or
 131:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****           through the PLL as System clock source. Can be used also as RTC clock source.
 132:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c **** 
 133:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****       (#) LSE (low-speed external), 32 KHz oscillator used as RTC clock source.
 134:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c **** 
 135:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****       (#) PLL (clocked by HSI or HSE), featuring different output clocks:
 136:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****         (++) The first output is used to generate the high speed system clock 
 137:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****         (++) The second output is used to generate the clock for the USB (48 MHz)
 138:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c **** 
 139:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****       (#) CSS (Clock security system), once enable using the function HAL_RCC_EnableCSS()
 140:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****           and if a HSE clock failure occurs(HSE used directly or through PLL as System
 141:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****           clock source), the System clocks automatically switched to HSI and an interrupt
 142:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****           is generated if enabled. The interrupt is linked to the Cortex-M4 NMI
 143:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****           (Non-Maskable Interrupt) exception vector.
 144:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c **** 
 145:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****       (#) MCO (microcontroller clock output), used to output SYSCLK, HSI,
ARM GAS  C:\Users\user\AppData\Local\Temp\ccuc8vss.s 			page 4


 146:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****           HSE or PLL clock (divided by 2) on PA8 pin
 147:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c **** 
 148:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****     [..] System, AHB and APB buses clocks configuration
 149:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****       (#) Several clock sources can be used to drive the System clock (SYSCLK): HSI,
 150:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****           HSE and PLL.
 151:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****           The AHB clock (HCLK) is derived from System clock through configurable
 152:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****           prescaler and used to clock the CPU, memory and peripherals mapped
 153:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****           on AHB bus (DMA, GPIO...). APB1 (PCLK1) and APB2 (PCLK2) clocks are derived
 154:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****           from AHB clock through configurable prescalers and used to clock
 155:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****           the peripherals mapped on these buses. You can use
 156:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****           "@ref HAL_RCC_GetSysClockFreq()" function to retrieve the frequencies of these clocks.
 157:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c **** 
 158:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****       -@- All the peripheral clocks are derived from the System clock (SYSCLK) except:
 159:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****           (+@) RTC: RTC clock can be derived either from the LSI, LSE or HSE clock
 160:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****               divided by 128.
 161:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****           (+@) USB : USB require a frequency equal to 48 MHz
 162:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****               to work correctly. This clock is derived of the main PLL through PLL Multiplier.
 163:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****           (+@) IWDG clock which is always the LSI clock.
 164:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   @endverbatim
 165:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   * @{
 166:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   */
 167:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c **** 
 168:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c **** /*
 169:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****   Additional consideration on the SYSCLK based on Latency settings:
 170:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****         +-----------------------------------------------+
 171:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****         | Latency       | SYSCLK clock frequency (MHz)  |
 172:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****         |---------------|-------------------------------|
 173:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****         |0WS(1CPU cycle)|       0 < SYSCLK <= 25        |
 174:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****         |---------------|-------------------------------|
 175:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****         |1WS(2CPU cycle)|      25 < SYSCLK <= 50        |
 176:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_rcc.c ****         |---------------|-------------------------------|
